    GET /api/v1/analytics/lifetime?vehicle_id=
    Computes the full envelope: total_drives, total_distance_km,
    total_driving_hours, longest_drive_km, highest_speed_kmh,
    avg_efficiency_wh_km, total_charge_sessions, total_energy_kwh,
